<section class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-center mb-8\">❓ Frequently Asked Questions About <!-- -->African Golden Wolf<!-- --> Names</h2><div class=\"space-y-3\"><details class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 group\"><summary class=\"font-semibold text-gray-800 cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\">What makes a good african golden wolf name?</summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">A good name matches personality, is easy to pronounce, and ideally 1-2 syllables.</p></details><details class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 group\"><summary class=\"font-semibold text-gray-800 cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\">Should I name based on appearance?</summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Yes! Distinctive features make wonderful naming inspiration.</p></details><details class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 group\"><summary class=\"font-semibold text-gray-800 cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\">Can I use a human name?</summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Absolutely. Human names are popular and make bonds feel more personal.</p></details><details class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 group\"><summary class=\"font-semibold text-gray-800 cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\">How many names to consider?</summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Shortlist 3-5 favorites, test them over several days.</p></details><details class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 group\"><summary class=\"font-semibold text-gray-800 cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\">What sounds work best?</summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Names ending in vowel sounds, especially &#x27;ee&#x27;, work best for recognition.</p></details><details class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 group\"><summary class=\"font-semibold text-gray-800 cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\">What makes a good name for a African Golden Wolf?</summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">A good African Golden Wolf name is clear, easy to pronounce, and fits your pet&#x27;s personality. Avoid names that sound like commands or household names. The best names often come from observing your African Golden Wolf&#x27;s habits and character — the right name will feel natural after a few days of use.</p></details><details class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 group\"><summary class=\"font-semibold text-gray-800 cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\">Can I give my African Golden Wolf a humorous or unusual name?</summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Absolutely — humorous and unusual names often become beloved conversation starters. The key is ensuring the name brings you joy rather than embarrassment when called in public. If you smile every time you say it, it&#x27;s the right name regardless of convention.</p></details></div></section><section class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-center mb-8\">📖 <!-- -->African Golden Wolf<!-- --> Naming Guide</h2><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm border border-gray-100\"><ul class=\"space-y-3\"><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-gray-700\"><span class=\"text-primary font-bold text-lg\">0<!-- -->1</span><span>Observe behavior before naming.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-gray-700\"><span class=\"text-primary font-bold text-lg\">0<!-- -->2</span><span>Choose easy-to-pronounce names.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-gray-700\"><span class=\"text-primary font-bold text-lg\">0<!-- -->3</span><span>Two syllables work best.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-gray-700\"><span class=\"text-primary font-bold text-lg\">0<!-- -->4</span><span>Test for a full week.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-gray-700\"><span class=\"text-primary font-bold text-lg\">0<!-- -->5</span><span>Avoid command-like sounds.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-gray-700\"><span class=\"text-primary font-bold text-lg\">0<!-- -->6</span><span>Involve family in naming.</span></li></ul></div></section><section class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-10 space-y-10\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8\"><div><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-center mb-6\">🔗 <!-- -->African Golden Wolf<!-- --> Name Categories</h2><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3\"><a class=\"bg-white rounded-lg px-4 py-3 text-center text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 hover:border-primary hover:text-primary transition-all\" href=\"/african-golden-wolf-names/\">📛<!-- --> <!-- -->African Golden Wolf<!-- --> <!-- -->Names</a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-lg px-4 py-3 text-center text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 hover:border-primary hover:text-primary transition-all\" href=\"/male-african-golden-wolf-names/\">♂️<!-- --> <!-- -->African Golden Wolf<!-- --> <!-- -->Male Names</a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-lg px-4 py-3 text-center text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 hover:border-primary hover:text-primary transition-all\" href=\"/female-african-golden-wolf-names/\">♀️<!-- --> <!-- -->African Golden Wolf<!-- --> <!-- -->Female Names</a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-lg px-4 py-3 text-center text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 hover:border-primary hover:text-primary transition-all\" href=\"/cute-african-golden-wolf-names/\">💕<!-- --> <!-- -->African Golden Wolf<!-- --> <!-- -->Cute Names</a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-lg px-4 py-3 text-center text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 hover:border-primary hover:text-primary transition-all\" href=\"/funny-african-golden-wolf-names/\">😂<!-- --> <!-- -->African Golden Wolf<!-- --> <!-- -->Funny Names</a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-lg px-4 py-3 text-center text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 hover:border-primary hover:text-primary transition-all\" href=\"/fantasy-african-golden-wolf-names/\">🧙<!-- --> <!-- --